        <mxCell id="3" value="&amp;lt;pre&amp;gt;%%{init: {&amp;#x27;theme&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;base&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;themeVariables&amp;#x27;: {&amp;#x27;primaryColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#EDF6F0&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;primaryTextColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#17324D&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;primaryBorderColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#315C7D&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;lineColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#526575&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;secondaryColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#F7F3E8&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;tertiaryColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#FFFFFF&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;fontSize&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;13px&amp;#x27;}}}%%&#10;sequenceDiagram&#10;    autonumber&#10;    actor User as Người dùng&#10;    participant App as Flutter app&#10;    participant Upload as UploadService&#10;    participant Proxy as FastAPI /uploads&#10;    participant Store as UploadStore&#10;    participant Storage as server/.uploads&#10;&#10;    User-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;App: Groundwork: chọn file lớn&#10;    App-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Upload: uploadDocument(bytes)&#10;    Upload-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: POST /uploads/presign(file_name, size_bytes) + X-App-Token&#10;    Proxy-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Store: generate_key + HMAC capability token&#10;    Store--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: key + put_url + token + expiry&#10;    Proxy--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Upload: presign response&#10;    Upload-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Storage: PUT /uploads/{key}?token=... (không dùng app token)&#10;    Storage-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Store: persist(stream, max 40 MiB)&#10;    Store--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Storage: atomic rename + metadata&#10;    Storage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Upload: 201 Created&#10;    Upload-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: GET /uploads/{key}/meta + X-App-Token&#10;    Proxy-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Store: meta(key)&#10;    Store--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: size + sha256 + uploaded_at&#10;    Proxy--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Upload: stored upload reference&#10;    Upload--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;App: UploadOutcome(reference, key, size, sha256)&#10;&#10;    Note over App,Proxy: Import/review hiện tại chưa gọi UploadService, upload:// groundwork chưa có consumer.&#10;    Note over Proxy,Store: PUT chỉ dùng capability token, hết hạn sau 1 giờ.&#10;&amp;lt;/pre&amp;gt;" style="text;html=1;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;visible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
